The flowerbed is a list of 1, 0, 0, 0, and 1.
The wanted is 1.
The last is the last position of flowerbed.
The planted is 0.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The here is item spot of flowerbed.
The leftfree is 1.
If spot is more than 0 and item (spot minus 1) of flowerbed is 1, set leftfree to 0.
The rightfree is 1.
If spot is less than last and item (spot plus 1) of flowerbed is 1, set rightfree to 0.
If here is 0 and leftfree is 1 and rightfree is 1, set item spot of flowerbed to 1, add 1 to planted.

If planted is at least wanted, show true, otherwise show false.
